              "DATADOG_CONFIDENCE_REASON:Source: The AuthenticationException message, which may contain user-provided input. Sink: response.sendError() on line 31. Dataflow: The untrusted message from the exception is passed directly to the response body within a 401 error message. Sanitization: None. Because HttpServletResponse.sendError() reflects the message in the response body without sanitization, it is susceptible to Reflected XSS when the exception message contains malicious scripts. Conclusion: This is a valid Reflected XSS vulnerability."
